Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:02.11,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:07.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera! Be my bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.43,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A dream? Of the barbarian? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:56.58,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1725)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFDFE&\3c&H3D6671&\4c&H372771&\shad2}T{\c&HF8FCFD&}h{\c&HF6FBFC&}e{\c&HF4FAFB&} {\c&HF2F9FA&}W{\c&HF1F8FA&}a{\c&HEFF7F9&}r{\c&HEDF6F8&}r{\c&HEBF5F7&}i{\c&HE9F4F6&}o{\c&HE7F3F5&}r{\c&HE5F2F4&} {\c&HE3F1F3&}P{\c&HE2F0F3&}r{\c&HE0EFF2&}i{\c&HDEEEF1&}n{\c&HDCEDF0&}c{\c&HDAECEF&}e{\c&HD8EBEE&}s{\c&HD6EAED&}s{\c&HD4E9EC&} {\c&HD3E7EC&}a{\c&HD1E6EB&}n{\c&HCFE5EA&}d{\c&HCDE4E9&} {\c&HCBE3E8&}t{\c&HC9E2E7&}h{\c&HC7E1E6&}e{\c&HC5E0E5&} {\c&HC4DFE5&}B{\c&HC2DEE4&}a{\c&HC0DDE3&}r{\c&HBEDCE2&}b{\c&HBCDBE1&}a{\c&HBADAE0&}r{\c&HB8D9DF&}i{\c&HB6D8DE&}c{\c&HB5D7DE&} {\c&HB3D6DD&}K{\c&HB1D5DC&}i{\c&HAFD4DB&}n{\c&HADD3DA&}g
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.86,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.74,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What are you asking? Why wouldn't \NI be sleeping in my bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:25.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why am I in your bedroom?! \NAnd why are you nude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.25,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You're making a real fuss \Nfor how early it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's good to see you're so full \Nof energy, after last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:38.14,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What happened last night...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.54,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything, \Nand I'm not sure I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:46.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Did you not just say you \Nwouldn't force yourself on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:49.88,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Come now, let's not quibble over details.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.53,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do not treat a lady's chastity \Nas some trifle, you animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.67,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:59.82,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's bad enough I've been \Ntaken captive by barbarians...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.85,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,if I were to bear his child,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:04.16,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'd be giving rise to another \Nenemy to my homeland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.42,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:11.30,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What sense does that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:15.93,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If you wanted to kill me, \NI'd understand, but why seek to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:19.68,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You would never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.18,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,The shame of being defeated\Nand taken captive in battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:26.17,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Compounded by the shame of attacking \Na nude, unarmed opponent, in a rage...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.54,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,All these things disgrace \Na knight's honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:32.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,So, before I become any \Ngreater of an embarrassment,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.95,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I would rather you put \Nme out of my misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:39.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly sounds unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.41,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,U-Unpleasant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.57,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,How else would you describe your belief
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:47.58,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,that shame and embarrassment are\Nenough to make one yearn for death?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:51.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make light of shame\Nand embarrassment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.88,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,These things may be of\Nno concern for you barbarians,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:55.92,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,but for a noble lady—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.34,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.80,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Your clothes have dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:03.27,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You woke up with no trouble.\NYou're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:04.73,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:07.77,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,After Master Veor returned yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:15.28,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,you had a mild overdose of the sleeping \Ndrugs used to transport you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:18.50,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,so you suddenly started \Nvomiting, before collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:21.74,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You had me quite worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.79,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I collapsed? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:29.04,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's what you meant about... last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:33.66,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I should apologize. It was administered \Nin the same dosage that my people use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.37,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's a type of paralytic poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:37.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,so you were brought to my \Nroom so you could rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.08,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Paralytic poison?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:41.27,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It slows the flow of blood, \Nwhich makes it good
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:43.07,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,for helping wounds close, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.33,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then... nothing was done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:49.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Other than a misapplication \Nof medicine, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:52.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I can't have you dying so soon \Nafter I've decided to wed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.49,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't be so confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:58.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Hand me a sword! I need \Nto beat some sense into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Looks like I don't need \Nto worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:04.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,And the breakfast preparations \Nwon't go to waste, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Breakfast...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:10.70,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes. You haven't eaten anything in the \Nday since you left the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:11.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'd imagine you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:15.57,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting in the other room, \Nso come along once you've calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.46,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Hey—Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:26.41,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't believe that a \Nknight such as myself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:28.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,has been given shelter by barbarians...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.79,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:35.42,Flashback,Gadius,0,0,0,,I taught you, my granddaughter, \Nmy swordplay since you asked to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:37.48,Flashback,Gadius,0,0,0,,and you've proven to be \Na bit too talented...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.39,Flashback,Gadius,0,0,0,,Maybe if you were a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:45.56,Flashback,Gadius,0,0,0,,or could give up on being a knight... \Nyou might've known some happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:50.00,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Serafina. You've rejected \Nanother marriage proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.01,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,Wanting to be a knight, as a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.38,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,how long are you going to \Nindulge this selfishness?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:57.56,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,You've more than established yourself \Nas a leader of knights at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.28,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,You need to get married while \Nthere are still viable prospects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.00,Flashback,Sidius,0,0,0,,A sword has never changed policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.27,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.27,0:06:08.93,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I sensed a profound \Nsincerity from your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.43,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,It was enough that I fell \Nfor you in that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:15.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I've paid so little mind to my\Nfemininity, the last thing I need
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,is to suddenly be desired for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.57,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,No... no, that isn't \Nthe last thing I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:23.05,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Considering he's a barbarian, \Nand I'm a prisoner of war...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.20,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,That is the entirety of the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:31.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,And the breakfast for a prisoner of \Nwar is likely to be the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:34.46,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,They say the best way to whittle one's \Nself-respect is through their diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:37.36,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But as a knight, I've dealt \Nwith military rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:39.67,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,so I doubt they can do much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:42.97,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will display the pride of \Nthe Lavillant clan that was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:45.64,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,chosen to be part of \Nthe Eastern Expedition!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.47,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There you are, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Come, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.23,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:58.69,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Where did this fatty meat come from? \NEven at home, something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:03.88,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,No, given the state of my homeland, \NI never came across such a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:07.36,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what a good portion would \Nbe for a female warrior from the west,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:09.99,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but I'm sure a quarter should suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:15.08,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,This is a quarter?! \NIt's bigger than my torso!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:19.01,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is this? Why would they \Npossibly be treating me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.13,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.59,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see. Your scheme is obvious, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:28.69,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Foisting such luxury on me to \Nwinnow away at my knight's pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:31.76,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,so that you might tame me, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:37.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,No matter! I would rather starve to \Ndeath than be indulged by barbarians!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:43.78,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Did my stomach really need to \Nrumble at that exact moment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,K-Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.41,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Are you fond of saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:52.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If your stomach still yearns for food,\Nit means your body wishes to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:57.05,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,To not eat, in spite of that, \Nis nothing more than self-deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,To say nothing of the disrespect \Nfor the life that was lost
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,so this food could be brought to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:04.80,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Taking a life should be a serious\Nmatter, not done out of sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.00,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Surely, the west isn't so \Ndifferent in what they believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:13.43,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,All that aside, stop second-guessing \Neverything and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.56,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.27,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,That smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is it, odd eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.69,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I should inform you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Though Master Veor didn't mention it, \Ngiven he took the fact for granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:32.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,this meat was hunted \Nspecifically to welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.70,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A welcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:37.12,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,On a hunt he went on, by himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:41.21,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,so that you would have something \Nfine to eat upon waking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:44.26,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor is as capable \Nas he is famous...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:46.91,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,He would be the equivalent of \None of your western royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:51.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I mean, if he's the son of some great \Nchief... that would make him a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:56.24,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Someone like that went to a lot of \Neffort to show you this hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:59.44,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Would turning away from it not \Nbe bad manners for a noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:07.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Fine. It would bring shame to my name \Nas a knight to reject such efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:13.74,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But if this is some paltry... so tender...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.41,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.49,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's so tender, but so juicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:29.18,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's a bit of gaminess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:32.78,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,but the flavor is good enough, \Nit comes across as a slight accent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.73,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I doubt even Illdoren royalty \Nget to eat something like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:40.27,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Glorious... too glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.44,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Well? Good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:48.28,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Well, I can hardly complain after \Nbeing served something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:51.22,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And while I don't intend on marrying you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:53.95,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,this is enough for me to overlook \Nthe matter of my drugging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.78,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That's good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:00.79,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I have to ask, as good as it tastes, \Nwhat manner of meat is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Care to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:05.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It was bled and the organs were \Nremoved up in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:08.55,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but the rest is being cleaned out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:11.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If you're curious, you can \Nlook from that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.58,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:18.68,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,If we could domesticate this animal \Nin my homeland, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.38,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of \Nthem in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:27.68,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's called a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:31.44,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,A-A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:34.69,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Th-This is dragon meat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:35.45,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.08,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,As in... the legendary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:41.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,flying monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.70,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That's apparently how \Nthey're viewed in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:48.45,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,They're supposed to breathe \Nfire and have toxic flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:51.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Those do exist, but this\N is a different breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:11:00.00,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That aside, Sera, I notice \Nyou're... not slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Well, if it tastes good, it tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:11.71,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I don't think she intends \Non dying any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:17.61,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to go outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:21.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes. There's something around the \Nmountain I'd like to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:26.74,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What? You look like the dragon \Nthat swallowed a wasp's nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:31.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Obviously I can't just trust \Nyou about something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:32.88,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's a matter of trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:36.41,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Of course it is! I've only been \Nyour prisoner for two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:39.38,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not that the length of \Ntime matters, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:41.93,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, it doesn't make sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,waltzing around lands filled \Nwith such bizarre creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:49.50,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You speak of sense, but surely common \Nsense varies depending on location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:53.02,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'd say different creatures and \Ncultures are a big part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:56.03,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Or is it simply that you're afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:04.14,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't deny that you've \Nbaited me into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:06.50,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.97,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,This doesn't mean I trust you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:14.20,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Obviously. Still, I get the feeling \Nyou'll take a liking to your surroundings,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,once you've seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.85,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And what are you basing that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:21.40,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There's no basis. \NIt's just a gut feeling, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.55,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:57.25,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,No... it's just... more bountiful, \Nand richer in nature than I had imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:13:00.18,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The battlefields we fought \Non were wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.60,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but the life in these lands \Nhas always been strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:06.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I just hope you don't faint from it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:08.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,D-Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:14.51,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Damned barbarian. The dragon and this \Nscenery were basically sneak attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:16.54,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I don't know what he \Nintends on showing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:19.78,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,but if I can brace for it, \NI won't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,So many animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:39.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Dragons are just another one of \Nthe inhabitants of these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.60,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,They're a pain to hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:45.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but if you leave their lairs alone, \Nthey don't bother humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make it sound so \Nsimple to get used to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.64,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It will be, once you live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:54.67,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You certainly seemed to enjoy \Nthe one you ate this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:58.32,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,M-My meat wasn't flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.32,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's no different than poultry, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:06.84,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:18.04,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Is that... a waterfall?! \NI've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.31,0:14:21.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sera? \NNot a sight you'd see in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:26.05,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me? \NMy homeland has its own...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.02,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,No. It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:37.31,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to brag, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:41.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But I did want you to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:46.57,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Now, then, there's one other \Nthing that brings us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:48.20,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.20,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:52.06,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,First of all... strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.90,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:55.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.79,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,There's only one thing a man and \Nwoman would do in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:14:59.86,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,without their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.96,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.32,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Bathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:06.82,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you have to say everything \Nin such a misleading way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.72,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Even if I'm getting used to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:13.31,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, why would you have \Nmixed bathing?! It's indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:17.41,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You can call it indecent, but that's \Nsimply how it's done around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:20.52,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Don't they say "When in foreign lands, \Ndo as the foreigners do"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.72,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not going to engage with \Nyour barbarian practices!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.59,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,My, you're a fierce one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:29.08,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're beginning to smell a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:33.04,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,We don't have bathhouses in our culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:35.74,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Wiping you down like\Nlast night can only do so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.00,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,It won't be long before \Nyou start to stink...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:43.00,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't believe you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Taking your clothes off with no \Nhesitation, in front of a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:49.64,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,On some level, it's just a \Nmatter of being used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.33,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor even went \Nto a different stream
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.09,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,because of the fuss you were making.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:56.87,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,So, I'm here to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.96,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,More like watch me, so I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:05.28,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,No, I'd say it has more to \Ndo with keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,My safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:12.62,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,There are other things out \Nhere, like the sawaiwao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:14.58,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:16.29,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't you "see?" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:21.29,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, they're all pretty docile \Nif they can be found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:25.78,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make it sound like we're \Nsurrounded by monsters or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.56,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Because we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:40.44,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,How can I bathe while \Nsurrounded by monsters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.36,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:43.94,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:47.44,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:54.39,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I ran off without thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:58.86,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But it was careless to leave my shoes \Nand clothes in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:04.70,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not happy about it, but I \Nsuppose I'll head back and get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:05.96,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:10.09,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Someone else is out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.56,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What'll happen if I run \Ninto a real savage,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:19.98,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,unlike the strangely rational Veor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:26.14,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,S-Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.74,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:37.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,S-So handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:41.37,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,A young barbarian warrior? \NAnd one that's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:44.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm hard-pressed to think of many \Nmen in the west who look so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:48.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Y-You! Stop staring!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:51.12,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,From the state of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.88,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'd guess some beasts appeared while \Nyou were bathing in the falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:58.32,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,My mother was a warrior \Nfrom the west, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:01.30,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I've heard stories like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:04.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,She would tell me, when I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:08.90,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,about how there was less nature and \Nfewer animals where she came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.87,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,From his age, that'd have to have \Nbeen in the 16th Expedition...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:15.84,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,A lady knight from 20 \Nyears ago is his mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:20.62,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm actually getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.70,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:31.05,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Honestly, a woman shouldn't \Nrisk catching a chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:35.32,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Let's head back to where your clothes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:37.93,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You can use my coat in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:39.43,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What a gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.90,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is a man who could be a western \Nknight doing among these barbarians?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.35,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Or is it just Veor, whose first \Nwords to me were about marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:48.82,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,that is abnormal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.06,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.45,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:57.95,Main - Top,Veor,0,0,0,,You're turning red, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:57.95,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Too close! His face is too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:02.70,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not good! I don't have enough experience \Nwith men to know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.46,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You might have trouble making it \Ndown the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:11.21,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,So be it. I'll have to \Ntouch you, so forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.55,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:21.20,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You're as light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.27,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.48,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Even I'm shocked at how\Nlittle resistance I can muster...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.48,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:31.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Oh, I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:35.61,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Sorry to ruin what seems\Nlike a nice moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:39.12,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,but how did this even happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:40.90,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:43.30,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Ve...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.00,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,What, you didn't realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:49.18,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I suppose I didn't get to tidy \Nmyself up before proposing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.76,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,All it took was a shave for \Nyou to blush like a maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You're an innocent one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:05.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a maiden, you barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:11.04,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,To slap with such force \Nfrom an unstable position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.78,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I knew I liked you for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:17.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're bright red. \NAre you going to be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:23.02,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,If I had a sword, it would've \Nbeen grounds for a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:27.79,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, this is your fault for \Ntaking me into that den of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.77,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You didn't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:31.62,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:36.42,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor patrols the areas where \Ndangerous creatures might appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:40.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You didn't seem to want any \Ncompany while in the nude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:43.18,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I had intended on protecting you \Nby your side, at first, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.76,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Compared to the yoitobari \Nwe had for breakfast,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:48.69,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,the inhabitants of the \Nriver are all peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Was that dragon that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:53.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:57.07,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,They have a wild temper, \Nbut are generally pretty cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:59.93,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Only you would say that, Master Veor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.93,0:21:04.73,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Even if they are herbivores, a dragon of \Nthat size is a danger for most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.73,0:21:06.83,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I can't argue with that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.58,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I got to see another side \Nof the woman I love today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:14.22,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It was a small price to pay, frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:17.83,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I will forgive you, this one time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:20.42,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,On account of how nice the scenery was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.22,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But it won't happen again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:25.47,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That's fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.47,0:21:29.36,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's a relief to know how \Ngracious my wife is, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.06,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wi—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:32.64,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide \Nthat I'm your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.50,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Really? Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:36.23,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't give me that look full of pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.19,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:45.37,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,What an absolute mess. Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:52.92,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I suppose he's easier \Non the eyes without that beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.64,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Only slightly, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.72,Time/Setting,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,264)\an2}Days later
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.89,0:22:03.72,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:08.58,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why?
